ck compensation."],"hlth":["Leverage is heavy at 5.4x net debt to EBITDA ($71.5M of cash against $2.5B of debt), and interest cover is thin at 2.4x.","Warning signs: an Altman Z of 1.54 in the distress zone, which caps the rating at HOLD."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 7.4% over 3 years, 5.3% over 5 years and 12.5% over 10 years, so growth is accelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 19%).","Free cash flow has compounded -0.4% a year over five years, short of the 5% durability bar.","Forward indicators: FFO growth of -0.4% a year over five years."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.4%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","It returns 5.3% a year to shareholders (5.7% in dividends).","The share count has grown 2.6% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It pays out 444% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 58 employees, each generates about $13.4M of revenue, 5.9x the Real Estate median, and productivity has risen 17.2% a year.","CEO pay is $3.5M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $196K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":26,"head":"Avoid: priced 145% above its fair value of $8.57.","pros":["Returns 5.3% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Trades 145% above fair value of $8.57","ROIC 3.1% vs WACC 6.6%","Net debt/EBITDA 5.4x","Interest coverage only 2.4x","P/E 77.9x vs sector 23.6x"],"flags":["Priced 145% above its fair value of $8.57"],"need":[],"buy_below":7.28,"vc":{"base":8.57,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":8.57,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.098,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":23.5593,"ev_ebitda":16.316,"pfcf":17.832,"pb":1.3568,"roic":0.0411,"gross_margin":0.5765,"fcf_margin":0.1733,"div_yield":0.0479}},"ticker":"SBRA","date":"2026-11-06"}